# The only Bankr secret this repo ever stores. A `bk_...` key from
# https://bankr.bot/api-keys — never an EVM private key, mnemonic, or
# Foundry keystore. Do not commit the real value.
#
# Read-only is enough for `address`. Read-write + Wallet API is required
# for `sign` (payout proof) and `submit` (deploy / fund / release).
BANKR_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to https://api.bankr.bot
# BANKR_API_URL=https://api.bankr.bot
